WEBVTT

00:03:30.579 --> 00:03:34.996
It is only made manifest in that daily
toil and the daily maintenance and

00:03:34.996 --> 00:03:38.204
the daily restoration that the ritual and

00:03:38.204 --> 00:03:43.538
the practice of participating
in creating the conditions

00:03:43.538 --> 00:03:48.204
for our family to live safely is
a part of the human condition.

00:03:49.913 --> 00:03:55.038
Four walls and a roof provide shelter,
but they can also comfort,

00:03:55.038 --> 00:03:59.663
inspire and sustain us, something
we're all realizing these days.